{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, sir. Environmental will go first. Regarding the used oil drums — I confirmed this morning that we have exactly 18 drums of used oil, and the contracted recycling service has accepted them. Pickup is available on 26 June. I do need to note that the contractor confirmation is currently in the environmental file but has not yet been added to the S-4 disposition worksheet, so we'll need to get that documented before you sign. For the other material categories — vehicle batteries, expired medical cold packs, and empty compressed-air cylinders — I'll defer to maintenance, medical-logistics, and transportation respectively for their updates."}
```

