{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Good morning, sir. Maintenance update on the vehicle batteries: I counted exactly 24 cases of vehicle batteries in the holding area. The approved battery vendor requires no more than 12 cases per pallet, so this shipment must use exactly two pallets, each with battery-hazard labels. The count and packing instruction are documented in the motor-pool inspection folder, but I have not yet sent them to logistics. We'll need to get that information onto the S-4 disposition worksheet before you sign, sir."}
```

